Final words — one single place to start labbing

Suggested small lab plan (do in order):

Create VPC + 4 subnets (publicA/privateA/publicB/privateB).

Create IGW + public route table.

Launch web server in public subnet; test.

Launch app server in private subnet; configure NAT gateway for private internet.

Set up bastion + test SSH (or SSM).

Create S3 gateway endpoint and test private S3 access from private instance.

Enable Flow Logs to S3 and run a sample Athena query.

Create VPC peering to another VPC (or simulate with second VPC).

Optional: create Transit Gateway and attach multiple VPCs.
